## This is NOT the Next.js you know

This version has breaking changes — APIs, conventions, and file structure may all differ from your training data.

**Before writing any Next.js code:**
- Read the relevant guide in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`
- Heed all deprecation notices found there
- Do not assume standard Next.js conventions apply without verifying them first
